<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LLM-based Multi-Agent Blackboard System for Information Discovery in Data Science</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Alireza Salemi<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>
